  "source_notes": {
    "strc_count_rollforward": "104,894,705 at June 30 less reported repurchases of 288,930 + 912,143 + 1,152,020 + 1,388,720 + 1,431,212 + 1,557,177 + 1,810,885 = 96,353,618. The September 8 primary states no shares were sold under the ATM during August 31\u2013September 7; the repurchase table has zero for STRF, STRK, STRD and MSTR. No unreported non-ATM preferred issuance is assumed.",
    "strc_payment": "Assumes the scheduled August 31 $0.50 dividend was paid; ordinary inclusive accrual September 1\u20137 is 7 days. The August 3 filing established August 31 and September 15 payouts at $0.50. A future declared September 15 dividend is not added in full. Direct company paid-status confirmation was not located; the public STRC page was dynamically rendered via web and returned HTTP403 to direct HTTP, so no further direct requests were attempted.",
    "strc_dividend_rate": "September 1 8-K maintains 12% for semi-monthly periods starting September 16; the preexisting 12% rate continues for September 1\u201315.",
    "strd_declaration": "September 1 8-K reports the board declared the September-quarter $2.50 per share on August 31. Section 6(a)(ii) includes declared and unpaid dividends accrued to the measurement date: 67/360 of annual $10, rather than the full $2.50.",
    "quarterly_accrual": "June 30 to September 7 is 67 days under the existing 30/360 certificate convention for STRF, STRK, STRE and newly declared STRD.",
    "base_pref": "September 7 is a Federal Reserve holiday; the last business-day adjustment is September 4. STRF $101.993 is the preceding ten-close mean assuming no issuance in the current or prior ten-session window; the conditional prior-close branch would be $104.40 if triggered. Other US series remain $100. STRE stays at EUR100 under the no post-IPO issuance premise.",
    "limitations": "Ending-count accrual is a reproducible estimate, not a paying-agent reconciliation; dividend record holders may retain rights after repurchases. No additional cash deductions are inferred. Counts except STRC carry June 30 until later changes are verified.",
    "latest_primary_confirmation": "Parent recovered the SEC primary through the authenticated Worker reprocess route and saved work/sep8-MSTR.html. Worker author confirmed explicit no ATM sales, no BTC purchases or sales, approximately 845,050 BTC held, and 1,810,885 STRC shares repurchased for $176.3m. No explicit dividend-paid statement is present."
